                    <th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Employee ID</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Greeting the customer with appropriate call opening in the prompt, warm, audible tone</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>RPC to be confirmed</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Introduce to self and Prior Bajaj Relation</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Inform purpose of call and ask for customer permission to proceed on the call</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Sounded confident, energetic and maintained voice modulation throughout the call</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Maintained Clarity and appropriate rate of speech throughout the call</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Active listening and avoided interruption</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Building Rapport and maintained over all call control & focus</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Apologized/ empathized whenever required</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason Type</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reason</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Remark</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Sound polite and courteous on call</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scored</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Scorable</th><th style='border:1px solid black;text-align: center;background-color: #FFE4C4;'>Reaso